    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good starting point. I'm specifically worried that these aren't just mistakes, but rather a series of tiny, almost \"hidden\" leaks in the budget that go unnoticed because of how irregular they are. Is there a way to use data sampling or statistical analysis to really isolate these specific little anomalies from the regular noise of the ledger?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
